      "message": "I think this is safe since the match rule serialization is introduced recently aosp/1892336. Nothing is really rely on the subscriberIdMatchRule field.\n\nSo here we use subscriberId is null to check.\n 1. if the template is for wifi (if any in OEM code) \u0026\u0026 IMSI is null, we matches regardless of IMSI.\n 2. if the template is for mobile \u0026\u0026 IMSI is null, in previous code it matches networks with IMSI \u003d\u003d null, which doesn\u0027t really make any sense since the policy won\u0027t match any normal mobile network. We\u0027ll change it to the wildcard template and it won\u0027t be persisted in next boot. Hence the issue is automatically recovered.",
